# Scripts and config read by Linux processes inside the all-in-one image, plus
# the CI pipeline file itself — force LF so Windows checkouts never introduce
# CRLF that breaks a shebang, a parser, or the Jenkinsfile's own shell blocks.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.lua text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.ini.example text eol=lf
Jenkinsfile text eol=lf
